{"id":"m4-205","m":4,"paper":"2019年湖北省选调生招录考试《综合知识和行政职业能力测验》题","region":"湖北","year":2019,"q":10,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2365985","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>某商店以5元/斤的价格购入一批蔬菜，上午以8元/斤的价格卖出总进货量的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d43716cf36224da5.png\" />，中午以上午售出价的8折卖出总进货量的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-23d85574dc6adf1c.png\" />，下午以中午售出价的一半卖出剩余货量的一半，最后获利210元。则该商店一共购入多少斤蔬菜？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"140"},{"k":"B","t":"150"},{"k":"C","t":"160"},{"k":"D","t":"180"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设一共购入<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c9bbb01440c47698.png\" />斤蔬菜，可将蔬菜出售情况列表如下：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/169a316419d8df1.png\" /></p><p>根据<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6f518c00e9d24571.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6dfb6b78f43a7783.png\" />，可列方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d260166d4ef8538e.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-752503fee4518cfb.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-96da86dff7020bb0.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2996535932d14c17.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e8a9785f284ddb84.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c6ea42e8003842c5.png\" />，即一共购入150斤蔬菜。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2365986","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲乙两仓库分别有粮食45吨和122吨，现甲仓库第一天运入3吨，往后每天运入的吨数比前一天多2吨，乙仓库每天运出2吨，则至少多少天后甲仓库的粮食比乙仓库多？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"6"},{"k":"B","t":"7"},{"k":"C","t":"8"},{"k":"D","t":"9"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9aedd74d109261c5.png\" />天后甲仓库的粮食比乙仓库多，根据等差数列求和公式<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fcab16985f51f0c8.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f1a64cfe188cd26c.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3c8e5f27ed4f7504.png\" />，可列式如下：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6544b40ae3be624e.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a3a896225965218d.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0db210f799537941.png\" />，化简为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a1333262f0f19fd4.png\" />。问至少从最小开始代入，代入A项，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1a34eb796ab5c669.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7e92051dbe0b9567.png\" />，排除；代入B项，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-894ef10748d9a749.png\" />，排除；代入C项，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-371703b7ffdd8e30.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-27ab1cb91fddf7c1.png\" />，符合题意，无需验证D项。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2365987","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某足球比赛售出40元、80元、120元门票共2000张，其中80元的门票数是120元的门票数的2倍，比赛门票收入共12万元。则40元门票售出多少张？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"1000"},{"k":"B","t":"1150"},{"k":"C","t":"1200"},{"k":"D","t":"1250"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设120元门票售出<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />张，则80元门票售出<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1160ffc37a9b6750.png\" />张，40元门票售出<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b4f4982abe4ed912.png\" />张，可列方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d21758063b6161ac.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5a6de8a9a9380ec4.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-024a796520c487bf.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-afcad4ec6a4e3fde.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-88c50704e4b0bed8.png\" />，即40元门票售出1250张。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2365988","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲超市某次抽奖活动仅限于情侣参加。活动规则如下：白、蓝、红三色小球分别有4个、3个和2个，情侣两人先后从9个小球中拿1个（每次取出小球后不放回），都拿白球为三等奖，都拿到蓝球为二等奖，都拿到红球为一等奖，其他情形不获奖。则每对情侣一次参加活动中奖的概率为：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7f33a378440a156f.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e4623be7ea111d58.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0e15ae6255f45abb.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意可知，两人先后均取出白球可获得三等奖，概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-18081264ee5a4648.png\" />，均取出蓝球可获得二等奖，概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8ce5fdd4674a2b6a.png\" />，均取出红球可获得一等奖，概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-abb5227e7cfdd738.png\" />。则获奖概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-945cc31a848b165e.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0cc296a9d417c839.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-abb5227e7cfdd738.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-05a191a3abe87453.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2365989","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>有一块三角形菜地<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-385e2c5b8a309e55.png\" />如下图，现计划将其分为四块区域种植不同蔬菜，如果<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f6b57c737549abcc.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1b3a91650e89c9cc.png\" />，三角形<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-645c5ab5659196e0.png\" />和三角形<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e9a2fcb5a537e44a.png\" />的面积之差为10平方米，则三角形<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-385e2c5b8a309e55.png\" />的面积为：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/169a3511d4b0d30.png\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"100平方米"},{"k":"B","t":"120平方米"},{"k":"C","t":"140平方米"},{"k":"D","t":"150平方米"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>因<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f6b57c737549abcc.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ab33b4f1dd7173d1.png\" />和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5eeb793994a96499.png\" />此条边上对应的高相等，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c8ce9ad6c4a570b3.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-394f04014c580df2.png\" />，同理， <img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1b3a91650e89c9cc.png\" />，可知<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-063bf3b4c8537ad4.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0be060fa8984a470.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6a84f8ae1bf5412c.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2fcbe1623d640fdb.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-42178a223225f8c7.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6a84f8ae1bf5412c.png\" />，整理得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-063bf3b4c8537ad4.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1abe478de9ae8afd.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2fcbe1623d640fdb.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-422600a9a2474e48.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6995b065b980d445.png\" />。由题干三角形<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-645c5ab5659196e0.png\" />和三角形<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e9a2fcb5a537e44a.png\" />的面积之差为10平方米，可知<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d605728bdf021f3b.png\" />平方米，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-600f5d52da31a274.png\" />平方米，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-461b3d0fdc960dea.png\" />平方米，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-280149a6ce6f6f6d.png\" />平方米，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-15fb9969991eee94.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3abb912756285d98.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-437b8541b1b9cd04.png\" />平方米。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2365990","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某商场会员全年购买该商场商品可享8折优惠，近日该商场举行店庆优惠活动。全场商品满199元减50元，满399元减100元，满599元减200元，会员优惠和店庆优惠每次只能享受一项。活动期间会员小兴分三次购买了价值260元、480元、640元商品各一件，则小兴最少需支付：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"1024元"},{"k":"B","t":"1026元"},{"k":"C","t":"1028元"},{"k":"D","t":"1030元"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>想要支付的钱数最少，需选择最优惠的活动。260元的商品打八折为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-47c1e59015f1f38d.png\" />元，参加满减为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ea56262d8f48f37d.png\" />元，应选择8折优惠；480元的商品打八折为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bbe79f825cbe727e.png\" />元，参加满减为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6fd548f3464a367c.png\" />元，应选择满减优惠；640元的商品打八折为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1cba8e8b2e69a592.png\" />元，参加满减为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-abe165881afcdbb3.png\" />元，应选择满减优惠。则最少需支付<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-61477001aae12255.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-028b88002594268c.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2365991","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某工厂加工零件，每个零件有正反两面，每台机床每次能同时加工两个零件，每次只能加工零件的一面，加工一次需要1.5分钟，则每台机床加工9个零件最少需要多少时间？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"13.5分钟"},{"k":"B","t":"14分钟"},{"k":"C","t":"14.5分钟"},{"k":"D","t":"15分钟"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：每次可以加工2面，耗时1.5分钟。9个零件共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1384662137be5a32.png\" />面，至少需要加工<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8abf4c69a1a9ceb7.png\" />次，至少耗时<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d3cfb0edfd56b146.png\" />分钟。</p><p>方法二：本题也可以枚举出所有情况，第1次至第6次分别加工前6个零件的正反两面，第7次加工第7个零件的正面和第8个零件的正面，第8次加工第7个零件的反面和第9个零件的正面，第9次加工第8个零件的反面和第9个零件的反面，一共9次，至少用时<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bb949b0e11c67b9d.png\" />分钟。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"2365992","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"吕某回乡开办土鸡养殖基地，某天他收获一筐土鸡蛋。每4个一组取出则多2个；每5个一组取出则少1个；每6个一组取出则刚好；每7个一组取出多1个。已知一筐最多能装500个土鸡蛋，如果每6个一组取出，需要多少次刚好取完？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"67"},{"k":"B","t":"69"},{"k":"C","t":"70"},{"k":"D","t":"72"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可知，土鸡蛋每5个一组取出少1个，所以土鸡蛋数量加1是5的倍数。直接代入选项，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-64bd540ab91dd9da.png\" />，得到的结果分别为403、415、421、433，只有415是5的倍数，故土鸡蛋总数为414个，需要取69次。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"2365993","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"因电路改造，电力公司计划未来十天对某小区选择三天停电，要求不能连续两天停电，则共有多少种停电方案？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"35"},{"k":"B","t":"56"},{"k":"C","t":"84"},{"k":"D","t":"120"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>10天里面，7天正常供电，3天停电，要求不能连续2天停电，考虑插空法。7天的排布共有8个空，将停电的3天分别插入8个空，则有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bbdce9917e577062.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-436914df71ca75ad.png\" />种停电方案。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":10,"qid":"2365994","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲、乙、丙三人分别骑自行车同时同地沿同一公路追赶前面的骑车人丁。甲、乙、丙分别用了6分钟、10分钟、15分钟追赶上丁。已知甲每分钟行0.4千米，乙每分钟行0.3千米，则丙每分钟行多少千米？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"0.24"},{"k":"B","t":"0.25"},{"k":"C","t":"0.26"},{"k":"D","t":"0.27"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可知，甲、乙、丙分别跟丁做追及运动。设甲、乙、丙和丁的追及距离为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9e8bb8e419dac2e4.png\" />，丁的速度为每分钟行<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />千米。根据追及公式，甲和丁可得方程<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4e42f9761ae2fcae.png\" /> ，乙和丁可得方程<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-529f283ce7535f87.png\" />，联立方程组解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a71e08bdb20df183.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-35c8614d21536bd3.png\" />。设丙每分钟行<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />千米，单独考虑丙和丁，代入追及公式可得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-513c4b366625f7db.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-200ecaf5c87f6482.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"}]}]}